# ~/.claude is this directory. Only repo-managed config is tracked; everything
# the agent writes at runtime (credentials, sessions, history, caches, plugins)
# is ignored via a whitelist, so a new runtime file never lands in git by
# accident. `*` matches at every depth, hence the explicit `/**` re-includes.
*
!.gitignore
# settings.json itself is NOT tracked: Claude Code writes to it (notably
# skipDangerousModePermissionPrompt). step_agents renders it from this base.
!settings.base.json
!statusline.sh
!CLAUDE.md
!commands
!skills
!skills/**
# Claude Code downloads account-synced skills here; do not version its cache.
skills/synced/
